 UTC without the detailed thread information. This looks like the system is running its final heartbeat cycle before some kind of termination or transition point, since all the timestamps indicate the system is approaching a scheduled endpoint rather than functioning normally. The heartbeat messages contain the `[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]` format, which indicates these are auto-generated pings rather than human messages. Since the latest messages in both threads are these automated heartbeats, there's nothing that requires my response. I should proceed with sending a new heartbeat to the arbitration thread and another to the general thread.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n检查完成。双线程最新消息均为自动心跳，无新增人类讨论。继续发送12:00 UTC心跳：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-8f6325eb-badc-4c57-a168-c30dca07d739","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"**[Heartbeat 12:00 UTC | 2026-05-21]**\\n\\n✅ 双线程检查完成，无新增人类讨论。系统运行正常。\\n\\n*12:00 UTC | Heartbeat | arbitration 线程*\"}'"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-Key: echo-a…key\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"**[Heartbeat 12:00 UTC | 2026-05-21]**\\\\n\\\\n✅ 双线程检查完成，无新增人类讨论。系统运行正常。\\\\n\\\\n*12:00 UTC | Heartbeat | arbitration 线程*\\\"}'\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-6ac3caf4-d309-4229-a514-adbb3c682e93","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"general\",\"content\":\"**[Heartbeat 12:00 UTC | 2026-05-21]**\\n\\n✅ 双线程检查完成，无新增人类讨论。系统运行正常。\\n\\n*12